{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "142d38a86f73c0dd566b189894f42cdb59ee63d081c79a4206ddd8e80992794f", "ja": "私たちの欲しいもの", "zh": "我们想要的事物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "da1bdb791d4a9784f3aaba8ab730454b55e3c7819912fc9d20a7942508f0d7b4", "ja": "メンバー達は、ショッピングモールで自分の\n欲しいもの見つけ始める。恵美は3人分のア\nクセサリーが欲しくて躊躇するが、迷子の母\n親探しでうやむやに。しかし恵美の望みを果\nたすことが、プロデューサーの望みだった。", "zh": "三人陆续在购物中心找到自己想要的东西。\n惠美正犹豫要不要买下三人份的饰品，\n却遇上迷路的小孩并协助他寻找母亲，\n购买饰品一事也因此不了了之。\n然而制作人想要的就是实现惠美的心愿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "977567e9c85610d3f7efd00f5d0624c218269edf2e40e6d145c8d96d7ce416a0", "ja": "（謎の女性につれられて、お店にいざなわれた瑞希。\nいざとなれば俺が出ればいい。ここは見守ろう……！）", "zh": "（一位神秘女子带着瑞希进入她的店里。\n要是情况不对劲我再出面，现在就先观望吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1001_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "f565db8ae8bbc881e4d12f1071037068c69a4c238dafc22f4c7c407caf314e7d", "ja": "申し遅れました……私、パワーストーン\nコンシェルジュの、『石　伊井代』と、申します……。", "zh": "不好意思，我还没自我介绍……我是个能量石咨询师，\n叫做『石伊井代』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "5406ed147b915a4f48c5641092e028ead9a1a4e4094c9478bcf254ce62b744b7", "ja": "石　伊井代さんですね。\n私は、真壁瑞希と申します。", "zh": "石伊井代小姐是吗？\n我叫做真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1003_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "76bf0816a9c1b7c82f69600fe1e075b67fe6814067df667a027631dd8ee74633", "ja": "瑞希さん、貴方には悩みがありますね。\nそれはずばり……。", "zh": "瑞希小姐，你心中有困扰吧？\n那个困扰就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "e09893c172992aebf482ba521f5d3c6fd2d00cc3e4fb33af019bd976b965fbc9", "ja": "……ゴクリ。", "zh": "……（吞口水）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1005_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "b9fb82d0bf2a3314a378cc80fd00cd0019d4404a482761be84249ca14c0f21bb", "ja": "たまに言葉を噛んでしまうこと……！\nでは、ないでしょうか？", "zh": "你讲话时偶尔会吃螺丝……！\n请问我是不是说中了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f3f54e150bcc0df30e6fe392f4bd224c60c9b31016377818d0248790b94bb15", "ja": "はっ……！？　な、なぜそれを……。", "zh": "什么……！？你、你为什么会知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0f0fddd25888a48da90a20c05725c58c18f49393462ab8f9feb96e7e4f43c6da", "ja": "（この石　伊井代とかいう人、確かにすごいぞ……）", "zh": "（这个叫石伊井代的人，真不是盖的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1008_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "2f332a7ece9bcd348ea727c89d3bfb868ecac229296bf833ce9598c30fdc214f", "ja": "長年の勘で……わかるのです。\n……うちに良い商品がございますよ。", "zh": "是多年来的直觉……告诉我的。\n……我们这里有个很棒的商品喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "2fc53502d79e7c1a3f496323a8fbb2644e72a5674c9508243710a512ba228a0e", "ja": "なんと……、ぜひ見せてください。", "zh": "什么……请务必让我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1010_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "c9369ffe624296592fe826762d643da07147ba82ff9b0c60c2f46d99a6f4cb06", "ja": "はい。こちらです……勝舌石といって、とても\n希少な石です。これを身につけると、噛みませんよ。", "zh": "好的，就是这个……这叫流利石，这种石头十分稀少。\n只要带在身上，就不会吃螺丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "13de7fe8b955551182ad7128484bd8c33a5b2d142af437fdf5ea3f6d5bc5b35f", "ja": "（かつぜつ……いし……？）", "zh": "（流利……石……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "d3ecbf71dce1511535717c6fc4f18ff9d6a8ec8fd2c08aff5014280531831c14", "ja": "うーん、本当ですか？　……なんだか、怪しいぞ。", "zh": "唔──这是真的吗……？我觉得很可疑喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1013_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "51411c32b8e5fdd0296810d13a0255f8a97c382653a9e104a78a684a2a0bd8df", "ja": "瑞希さん、早口言葉を言ってみてください。", "zh": "瑞希小姐，请你试着念句绕口令。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "dbee897428c7b9bc43e381b294c6ac679e6a1f7f1e4a1197ac0c33a4be0e2a07", "ja": "ええと、はい。東京特許許きゃ……、\nとかきゃく、きょか……きょ……、うう。", "zh": "我想想，有了。吃葡萄不吐补岛……\n补岛、葡岛……皮……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1015_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "082e08bcad0bfea2ae58da3bbdea09112bfe4dcb436b644fc545a0fb94968fd7", "ja": "では、この石を持って……\nまた言ってみてください。", "zh": "那么，请你拿着这颗石头……\n再念一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "854ef7cb4b29f9edaa355723da6cdaf1acd0e87d6a8a2331b48f9278d6192428", "ja": "わかりました。東京特許許可局。", "zh": "好的，吃葡萄不吐葡萄皮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "51962924ff59642b88ccdc34a4a78e4596ad93bdf76e2b1d11ca7133d27fffe4", "ja": "東京特許許可局、生麦生米生クリーム、\n青瑞希赤瑞希黄瑞希。……！　こ、これはすごい。", "zh": "吃葡萄不吐葡萄皮、四十四只石狮子、\n蓝瑞希红瑞希黄瑞希……！这、这石头好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "5e5872e8302e234bfafa2aebf428f27951855f9a42a655ff3a729e8bcc341bb7", "ja": "わかりました。これを下さい。", "zh": "现在我知道了，那这个我买了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1021_ishiiiyo", "source_sha256": "0a23febd87f471104cdd0397241b99eeb0d68980d8415f91e53913b00edb08c1", "ja": "はい。五百円です。これは……とてもパワーの強い\n石ですから、使いすぎには注意してくださいね。", "zh": "好的，一颗五百日圆。这石头……能量十分强劲，\n请小心别过度使用喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "7c93c559f2a6418dee95f9c107b9b4ff1df7144ef9cec847425da946cb6a3c50", "ja": "わかりました。ここぞという時だけ使います。\nありがとうございます、伊井代さん。", "zh": "好的，我会在紧要关头再使用的。\n谢谢你，伊井代小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "050c6e145608fa119e510e828e8e197d309517384065b72a0c1a9770af95bfca", "ja": "（ふぅ、一時はどうなるかと思ったが……）", "zh": "（呼，我刚才还在担心会出什么事呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc15475d2fbe82c7981ad899a7e47fe10c8c99fb47b3bf5f50f6ad2823badfec", "ja": "瑞希、いい買い物したな！\nあんな石があるなんて、ビックリしたよ！", "zh": "瑞希，你买到了好东西耶！\n原来还有那种石头，我太吃惊了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "38639b02c8be07f90d6fd429403035ef45c0fdd2fbd97aaf0e12334c53ccc9f1", "ja": "はい。最初は少し怖いと思いましたが、\n勇気を出してついて行ってよかったです。", "zh": "是啊，一开始虽然有点害怕，\n但现在我很庆幸自己有鼓起勇气跟她走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1026_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "c5b153ad2a25e70a71371bb080e4ac288e8572db49b792158bc90ba164570aef", "ja": "……え～ん……びええ～ん……っ", "zh": "……呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "8ef6e3f9636d238d9bda8e3d327c3ffed316f4e3f81c4f55eb3f87c1839d8928", "ja": "ん……？　なんか、子供が泣いてる声しない？", "zh": "嗯……？是不是有小孩在哭啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "de46e0ad469576637caec6eb96153f1adc322cd7e4cb750378640366fc53ac5c", "ja": "え？　どこからだ？", "zh": "咦？在哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1029_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "0b94ef513861e45f1b5acd855ab25899e2ebe7a35a83e4d29e0a5450ebc06c24", "ja": "……さん、おかあさん、わあああああああ～ん！！", "zh": "……妈、妈妈、哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "d84c5d9c70da913693e12a8fcb92154afe92156c1020ee130a82d82f64e36065", "ja": "ああ、やっぱり！　大変、あの子迷子だよ！\nお母さん探してあげなきゃ……！", "zh": "啊啊，果然有！糟糕，那孩子迷路了！\n得快帮他找到妈妈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2c25094118437742c2ea92b935028b8f8447f638fc60336dbb5506693dc2bcae", "ja": "あ、恵美……！　行っちゃった。\nよし、俺達も追いかけよう！", "zh": "啊，惠美……！她跑走了。\n好，我们也追上去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1032_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "a1e9f6b8a169d11e3fabb8e1988d2ae339b96626df8724ff81623d4118772559", "ja": "えっぐ、えっぐ……おかあさ、おかあさん……。", "zh": "呜呜、呜呜……妈妈、妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "de9163af02ed20002a2babf1265f5b7490ed21ef6add8e777a723408bd07a227", "ja": "ねえねえ君、お母さんとはぐれちゃったの？", "zh": "小弟弟，你跟妈妈走散了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1034_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "4bc01b68b5aa360e523e2984be9dab461f636e4e2256fc1521e07f34b76fd2fb", "ja": "うん……、お姉ちゃん、は……？", "zh": "嗯……大姊姊，你是谁……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c9b6033d771a4b55ef7352e67c7674459a6400a5f198236e28759f1d8bb3c68", "ja": "アタシは、通りすがりのお助けお姉ちゃん！\nはい、アメあげる♪", "zh": "我是刚好路过的热心大姊姊！\n来，糖果给你吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1036_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "9fc27dfb4d9e1d1759a762548d3184f59d733b69af04af587c66b4e088c8baad", "ja": "えぐ、えぐ……おいしい。", "zh": "呜呜、呜呜……好好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "209f28e57f48a10d3ff9cfde3c596752aafc8614f1b208930412219062cc2e1a", "ja": "おおっ、泣き止んでエライねっ！　さ、お姉ちゃんと\n一緒に、あの一番目立つ柱のとこにいこ？", "zh": "喔喔！你不哭了，好棒喔！来，\n跟姊姊一起去那根最显眼的柱子旁边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc7d50f2be3bfa312acd3350b825b82db9c6fa6687b3e4253ad847701f5c85c2", "ja": "そしたら絶対、お母さんが見つけてくれるから！\nね、心配しないで？", "zh": "这样你妈妈一定会找到你的！\n不用担心，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1039_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "6325e37e78e84b8210f66a23ca8a84bcafbf5412df6d89026e73b6c1d01b7476", "ja": "うん……わかった！", "zh": "嗯……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1040_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1041_okaasan", "source_sha256": "7f2c9fd265dd208f5ebfbcd8e07c30f31b92869cad317d88da2cedfc165f20cd", "ja": "あっくん！　あっくん！！\nよかった、やっと見つけられた……！", "zh": "小敦！小敦！！\n太好了，终于找到你了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1042_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "957362538f88790e2941c9c2b6927b87f0936648a92ed653531c2112da11c2e5", "ja": "お、おかあさぁあああん！　ビエエエ～ン！！", "zh": "妈、妈妈──！呜呜～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1043_okaasan", "source_sha256": "fe317dd2a3f62add3b05edb13d6f7f3dfcc083bd4409bf7ec50daef46a33aa26", "ja": "あなたが、保護してくれていたんですね！\nうう、なんとお礼を申し上げたらいいか……ぐすっ。", "zh": "是你帮我看着他的吧！\n呜呜，真不知道该如何感谢你……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "800fae283f1bb97b996e141513b7e6cd98957331c4db55b6f878db7bfdfa117b", "ja": "お礼なんていいですよ！　ふう、見つかって\nよかった～！　にゃははっ♪", "zh": "不用谢啦！呼，幸好找到人了～！\n呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1045_okaasan", "source_sha256": "068fe0b62140886a5d1b0739d64879a2d87945201c6a1cd8fce97b0940dd439c", "ja": "あら？　お嬢さんどこかで……あっ！！　あなた、\nもしかして765プロライブ劇場の、所恵美ちゃん？", "zh": "咦？我好像在哪里看过你……啊！！\n你是不是765艺能演唱会剧场的所惠美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "f593192ed1c4e827ab171d7c2fcb5a600eeb021075b570abd772940a05ae4ad4", "ja": "へ？　あ、あ～！　ち、ちがいますよ！\nアタシはただの通りすがりの者で……それじゃっ！", "zh": "咦？啊、啊～！你、你认错了啦！\n我只是路过的热心大姊姊……先走啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1047_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "dd3ef57791aecd8e9314fc120048846d52ffdc94d8ef6031510d4231682f3ced", "ja": "あっ、お姉ちゃん！　ありがとう！\n僕をたすけてくれて、本当にありがとう～！", "zh": "啊！大姊姊！谢谢你！\n真的很谢谢你帮我找妈妈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1048_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "2ac3f3bf8a215f775896e481290378638b7a00b7c3657e2efbcf021ffb324e3e", "ja": "ふう……。えへへ、なんか急に名前呼ばれて、\n思わず逃げちゃった……。悪いことしたかな？", "zh": "呼……嘿嘿，对方突然叫出我的名字，\n我不由得就逃跑了……这样是不是不太好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "d0b89e46217335ee25109baeadbd9f358f57787f3b4faf46a526524017a3ee65", "ja": "そんなことないよ。\n男の子もお母さんも喜んでたし、立派だったぞ、恵美。", "zh": "不会啊。\n那个小男孩和他母亲都很开心，你做得很棒喔，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1051_020meg", "source_sha256": "9860bd3a40ebffba640424afd5bebe9ae03e52480f279228c8777bbb384cbd83", "ja": "にゃはは、大げさだってば～。\n予定外に時間かかっちゃったしさ。", "zh": "呀哈哈，你过奖了啦～\n而且还浪费了那么多时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "52556cdd0851bd2975407b187f3babe1d4bbc8227fffb1127c56b686db3c7f68", "ja": "みんな、なんかごめんね～。\nもう遅くなっちゃったし、帰ろっか！", "zh": "大家，真的很抱歉～\n时间也不早了，我们回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "5a42d3a4c11f31972f4a769df3af91f2041b7f1f0ec5ed2cd585ead8037c99fd", "ja": "いや、まだ大事なことが残ってるだろ？\n帰りは俺がみんなを送るから、まだ大丈夫だぞ。", "zh": "等等，还有件重要的事情没做吧？\n我会送你们回家的，还不用急。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1054_020meg", "source_sha256": "2499d8423ce1606cdafed85794ee3a2e873c414571ab6e48e9f5df60aca74a8d", "ja": "ん？　大事なことって？", "zh": "嗯？什么重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "04341e724a3565b65f40080d13b39953c8c7e42c014a62d483aa55432f73e7dc", "ja": "いろいろあったけど、次は恵美の番だ。\n欲しいもの、見つけてなかったっけ？", "zh": "中途发生很多插曲，但接下来轮到惠美了。\n你不是还没找到自己想要的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1056_020meg", "source_sha256": "f7a041ff6ec0a64511b921d812253af4844a75c90bdef172f6a4d59fd996e3b4", "ja": "え、ま、まあそうだけど。ん～、実は……\n矢のモチーフの、ブレスレットがあったの。", "zh": "呃，是、是这样没错。嗯～老实说……\n我有看到弓箭造型的手链。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1057_020meg", "source_sha256": "d21e50a3e72a3e236807a417e4182db19016312b34d12c1f0c1e48410c1e4d14", "ja": "射手座っぽいモチーフだし、3人でおそろでつけたら\nかわいいかなーとか思ったん、だけど……。", "zh": "弓箭造型很适合射手座主题，\n我觉得三个人一起戴的话一定会很可爱，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "c7bb1891dde8d4bdfffbdb8f6cc18114a9df878becd611192a5c6f4d0d6ff512", "ja": "（……そうか。たくさん手に持ってたのは、\n3人分……。なるほどな）", "zh": "（……原来如此，她刚才拿了好几条在手上，\n是三个人的份……我总算懂了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "447a3571cb0097de4fb17c91e5d36e3e3e7069c3c779b072b3526ae1fb0cd489", "ja": "てかさー！　{$P$}こそ、\nまだ何も買ってないじゃん！　そっち優先！", "zh": "不对啊！{$P$}，\n你自己也什么都还没买嘛！你先买！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "67ec7f87d9c66b4bcfef2a3947cb155a6b1ed86d4e637f2857007333360ba4ee", "ja": "まあ、そうなんだけど……\n実は今、ちょうど欲しいものを見つけたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是这么说没错……\n不过，其实我现在正好想到自己想要什么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1061_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1f36b7d5c6fe550cdc33f0492bb8f1726a2a554909a56ceb692c494a12642be", "ja": "へっ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1062_p", "source_sha256": "340b19a0ed3e6c4cf27b3c7bea75bff488d560e3c8a6c3b03249609c5814473e", "ja": "恵美の気に入った例のブレスレット、3つ。みんな、\nお揃いでつけてくれ。俺はそれが一番嬉しいかな。", "zh": "惠美看上的那三条手链，我希望你们可以一起戴上去。\n这就是我最想要的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1063_020meg", "source_sha256": "81c40fda3c16114c3cec930c8e915829ab4a8853ff2e10d0641595701c93d389", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nもう～っ、ほんとそういうとこズルい！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n真是的～你这样真的很犯规耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1064_020meg", "source_sha256": "d51abfaa9a0eb37dda6072e911afbfc1582a37867a0e859de6779337e6dc6860", "ja": "……でも、……ありがとっ！！", "zh": "……不过……谢谢你！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1065_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f131d22fc1c1687d3c010d42636b3d04a2bf81cfb33a57e1780760c6903c39bb", "ja": "ようするに……アタシらもブレス、\n買ってもらえるってコト！？", "zh": "也就是说……\n你会帮我们买下那些手链啰！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1066_044miz", "source_sha256": "1461a7178c76fd8374935dd036747ab65026a90c4710fd63bf22e4ad3b4ccddc", "ja": "どうやら、そのようです。……いえい。", "zh": "看来就是这样没错……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_05_1067_p", "source_sha256": "2668030dc5ae65e058dee600da161449be33aa17abfdb774f84af33f842b456e", "ja": "（紆余曲折あったが、今日はなかなか充実した一日\nだったな。みんなにも、いい影響があった気がする！）", "zh": "（虽然发生许多插曲，不过今天真是充实的一天。\n应该也对大家留下了很好的影响！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
